    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p30-q9-a",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{2^{x+1}-2^{x-2}}{2^{x-1}-2^{x+2}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-\\dfrac12$\n\nFactor out the smallest power of 2 in each difference.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{2^{x+1}-2^{x-2}}{2^{x-1}-2^{x+2}}&=\\frac{2^{x-2}(2^3-1)}{2^{x-1}(1-2^3)}\\\\\\frac{2^{x+1}-2^{x-2}}{2^{x-1}-2^{x+2}}&=\\frac{7\\times2^{x-2}}{-7\\times2^{x-1}}\\\\\\frac{2^{x+1}-2^{x-2}}{2^{x-1}-2^{x+2}}&=-\\frac12\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q9-b",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x^{\\frac12}y^{-\\frac12}-x^{-\\frac12}y^{\\frac12}}{x^{-1}-y^{-1}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$-(xy)^{\\frac12}$\n\nWrite both differences as fractions, then cancel the common factor. Here $x,y>0$ and $x\\ne y$.",
          "worked": "For $x,y>0$ and $x\\ne y$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x^{\\frac12}y^{-\\frac12}-x^{-\\frac12}y^{\\frac12}}{x^{-1}-y^{-1}}&=\\frac{(x-y)/\\sqrt{xy}}{(y-x)/(xy)}\\\\\\frac{x^{\\frac12}y^{-\\frac12}-x^{-\\frac12}y^{\\frac12}}{x^{-1}-y^{-1}}&=\\frac{xy(x-y)}{\\sqrt{xy}(y-x)}\\\\\\frac{x^{\\frac12}y^{-\\frac12}-x^{-\\frac12}y^{\\frac12}}{x^{-1}-y^{-1}}&=-\\sqrt{xy}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 39
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q9-c",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x-1}{x-x^{\\frac12}-2}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{x^{\\frac12}-1}{x^{\\frac12}-2}$\n\nFactorise in $\\sqrt{x}$ and cancel $\\sqrt{x}+1$. Here $x\\ge0$ and $x\\ne4$.",
          "worked": "For $x\\ge0$ and $x\\ne4$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x-1}{x-x^{\\frac12}-2}&=\\frac{(\\sqrt{x}-1)(\\sqrt{x}+1)}{(\\sqrt{x}-2)(\\sqrt{x}+1)}\\\\\\frac{x-1}{x-x^{\\frac12}-2}&=\\frac{\\sqrt{x}-1}{\\sqrt{x}-2}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 33
      },
      {
        "id": "p30-q9-d",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "d",
        "prompt": "$\\dfrac{x-y}{x^{\\frac12}-y^{\\frac12}}$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x^{\\frac12}+y^{\\frac12}$\n\nUse the difference of two squares. Here $x,y\\ge0$ and $x\\ne y$.",
          "worked": "For $x,y\\ge0$ and $x\\ne y$:\n$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{x-y}{x^{\\frac12}-y^{\\frac12}}&=\\frac{(\\sqrt{x}-\\sqrt{y})(\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{y})}{\\sqrt{x}-\\sqrt{y}}\\\\\\frac{x-y}{x^{\\frac12}-y^{\\frac12}}&=\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{y}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 26
      }
    ]
  },
